  "evidence": [
    "Actual static v1/beta Gateway ingress deserializes i32 ports without selected non-v1 full-schema adapter checks; static factory constructs GatewayHandler(None,None).",
    "Processor continues after validate; ordinary listener ports lack range checks in both phases. A sole otherwise-valid HTTP listener receives Accepted/Programmed success without invented conflicts.",
    "Controller and Gateway startup/HTTP builder derive identity using the same unchecked u16 cast: 65537 becomes 1 before bind.",
    "Existing canonical predicate/schema require 1\u201365535. Invalid-generation withdrawal can clear projections and replace registration contributions while retaining status and route refresh.",
    "A diagnostic alone is insufficient; bounded gate before all derived contributions is necessary. Frozen startup sockets and serial/inline status contracts preserved. P2 incorrect admission/identity; no successful bind, incident or admission-bypass claim."
  ],
